ed on the perf module's\nPG14/PostGIS 3.5 image that is ~8.4ms, flat whether the query returns 1 row or\n200, and ~0.1ms on every later call in the same session.\n\nConnection pooling hides this in steady state, but it inflates any query timed\non a fresh connection. It made ST_AsBinary(te.geometry) look like ~8ms of\nper-query geometry work in the tracked entity export when the function itself\ncosts nothing measurable on a warm connection.\n\nshared_preload_libraries loads the library once at postmaster start so every\nbackend inherits it via fork(), taking the first call to ~1.0ms with no\nper-connection cost. session_preload_libraries reaches the same first-call\nnumber without a restart but moves ~8ms onto every connection, including those\nthat never touch geometry.","author":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"},"id":"84f5f604decef2192ac3e83d030b6c788bf7070c","tree_id":"0caaed84e9f8151270755141c3cdc63689202662","timestamp":"2026-09-17T14:03:23Z","committer":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https:/